    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'In this minigame, the four players compete in an arena where the objective
    is to be the player that is tagged for the least amount of time. In the beginning
    of the game, a player is randomly chosen as the tagged player. This player tries
    to tag one of the other players. If successful, the other player becomes tagged
    and will now try to tag the others. The players are ranked based on the amount
    of time they are tagged in total. '
